// Regression (FV audit 2026-09-20): a plain local that happens to share its
// NAME with a `ghost(name := e)` binding created in ANOTHER module must stay
// an ordinary binding. The escape gate asks the RESOLVED Variable's own
// `is_ghost_binding` flag, not a process-global name set — loading
// valid/ghost_binding.yo (ghost(prev := x)) used to poison every later
// module's plain local `prev` for the rest of the process, so a multi-file
// `yo verify` run rejected unrelated modules
// (issues/fixed/ghost-binding-escape-gate-is-a-process-global-name-set.md).
// The verifier_ghost test loads ghost_binding.yo BEFORE this file in the
// same process.
pragma(Pragma.Verify);

bump :: (fn(x : i32) -> (result : i32))({
  prev := x;
  prev = (prev + i32(1));
  prev
});
